Wake up early enough and probably you 18 （hear） a pleasant chorus of birds. This early singing can
start as early as 4 a. m. and last for several hours. Birds do it 19 （attract） mates and warn other birds to avoid
their place. One theory as to 20 they choose the early morning to communicate these important messages is that
the low visibility makes it hard to do other bird activities, like searching for food. Keeping their activity level low,
